  https://github.com/lamethods/data2/tree/main/srl

The `srl` rows are ordered by student and occasion; the data values are
unchanged.

The bundled `esm_srl` data set is the package authors' own
experience-sampling study, fully anonymized before distribution: the
participant identifiers are fictional names and the calendar dates were
shifted by a constant offset, preserving within-person spacing while
removing all real dates and identities. The copy in this package adds a
`day_type` column derived from the anonymized dates.
